*   **screen_in**: Comes with the 10-inch central touchscreen and 12-inch digital instrument cluster on most trims (Source [2], [4], [7], [9], [12], [13], [16], [19], [20], [23], [25], [30], [37], [39]). Above average screen size. Score: 0.20.
*   **infotainment_ux_rating**: The system is generally easy to use, but some reviews mention it can be sluggish (Source [2], [11], [12], [19], [21], [25], [26]). Average. Score: 0.00.
*   **smartphone_connect_rating**: Apple CarPlay and Android Auto standard, often wireless (Source [2], [4], [5], [6], [7], [11], [13], [16], [19], [20], [30], [31], [32]). Above average. Score: 0.50.
*   **audio_rating**: Standard audio system, typically 6 speakers (Source [7], [16], [20]). Score: 0.00.
